_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"vista8","display_name":"向阳乔木","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXea3fua4AAotHV.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1960882043249942533/h4J39ERy_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":83,"view":51829,"like":77,"quote":3,"reply":65,"repost":3},"comments":[{"handle":"yc000009","display_name":"洋葱｜AI会员代充｜TRX能量","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2119263889531826176/XFXuOWNy_400x400.jpg","text":"Neon 一出来我就也想切过去试试，「哪家强就立马跟」这点挺真实。为了用它去开 Antigravity，工具不是最顺的，但模型在那儿就只好跟过去。你实际用 Neon 做活时，跟之前常用的比，哪类任务切过去最值？Antigravity 上手别扭的地方，用久了会不会好一点？","published_at":"2026-11-19T16:55:26+08:00","url":"https://x.com/yc000009/status/2123339354924110267","like":0},{"handle":"AINoSleep","display_name":"AINoSleep","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2106776628764532737/sRsDUc9N_400x400.jpg","text":"这个账号地区限制最头疼的事情","published_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:11+08:00","url":"https://x.com/AINoSleep/status/2123339041823432848","like":0}]},"translated":false},{"id":"x-vista8:2123229887226105885","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-vista8","source_name":"向阳乔木","title":"","summary":"如果到不了深圳GEO大会现场的，可以加群，到时候群里放直播。","body":"如果到不了深圳GEO大会现场的，可以加群，到时候群里放直播。","url":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2123229887226105885","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:40:27+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"vista8","display_name":"向阳乔木","media":[],"quote":{"handle":"yaojingang","display_name":"姚金刚","text":"第二届GEO大会，还有两天开始\n\n时间是11月21日-22日，一共2天，线下名额已满，欢迎大家通过线上直播和社群的方式参与\n\n线上两天的直播预约通道以及直播交流群已开启：\n1、通过图一，微信扫码可预约两天线上的全程直播\n2、通过图二，可加入线上GEO大会直播交流社群","url":"https://x.com/yaojingang/status/2123226515735232671","published_at":"2026-11-19T09:27:03+08:00"},"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1960882043249942533/h4J39ERy_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":2,"view":4897,"like":8,"quote":0,"reply":5,"repost":1}},"translated":false},{"id":"x-vista8:2123095504024437155","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-vista8","source_name":"向阳乔木","title":"","summary":"按网友建议，增加单词收藏和复习。 支持打字复习、回想复习，导出 Anki 等。 预计明天发版。 https://t.co/EoIMPcp9T8","body":"按网友建议，增加单词收藏和复习。\n\n支持打字复习、回想复习，导出 Anki 等。\n\n预计明天发版。 https://t.co/EoIMPcp9T8","url":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2123095504024437155","image":{"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXa_1KzakAA7Sfl.jpg","width":1052,"height":840},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:46:28+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"vista8","display_name":"向阳乔木","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXa_1KzakAA7Sfl.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXa_-LwbAAIAvlu.jpg"}],"quote":{"handle":"vista8","display_name":"向阳乔木","text":"好的海外播客动辄两三个小时，英文听着累，又没有中文字幕。\n\nSubCast 帮你解决播客学习痛点，边听、边问、边学。\n\n1. 支持搜索订阅全网播客节目，无论国内国外\n2. 提供本地 ASR 模型，转写无字幕音视频\n3. 支持 LLM 问答，本地 CLI 和 API 配置\n4. AI 导读、时间戳跳转、金句海报、收听统计\n\n给权限后，还能一键导入 Youtube 订阅频道。\n\n项目开源，下载地址在评论区","url":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2122712433441849731","published_at":"2026-11-17T23:24:16+08:00"},"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1960882043249942533/h4J39ERy_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":86,"view":9631,"like":106,"quote":0,"reply":29,"repost":5},"comments":[{"handle":"sahuaja3669","display_name":"老王实验室","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2107470619965353984/taQsgPb4_400x400.jpg","text":"收藏词如果能一起保留原句和那几秒音频，复习会更有意思：不是只记中文释义，而是想起当时为什么这样说。导出 Anki 时也把节目和时间点带上，忘了语境还能一键回去听。单词有了来处，就不只是又一张收藏清单。","published_at":"2026-11-19T01:01:47+08:00","url":"https://x.com/sahuaja3669/status/2123099362586657082","like":0},{"handle":"jinhuaachen","display_name":"进化中的阿陈","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2107413308265701377/fYYUA8vi_400x400.jpg","text":"收藏按钮最好按，复习按钮最考验人。","published_at":"2026-11-19T00:55:49+08:00","url":"https://x.com/jinhuaachen/status/2123097858790568117","like":0},{"handle":"blockphd7","display_name":"Blockphd区块博士.Ai 🎒","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2103788977400725504/Ie6hYi5r_400x400.jpg","text":"太高效了！","published_at":"2026-11-19T00:47:09+08:00","url":"https://x.com/blockphd7/status/2123095677081420194","like":0}]},"translated":false},{"id":"x-vista8:2122984134519972212","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-vista8","source_name":"向阳乔木","title":"","summary":"什么是聪明的模型？ Opus 5.5 就是，你以为它没考虑到，其实早就帮你做了.... 登录后台截图做 Gif 图，还自动帮打码遮住敏感信息。","body":"什么是聪明的模型？\n\nOpus 5.5 就是，你以为它没考虑到，其实早就帮你做了....\n\n登录后台截图做 Gif 图，还自动帮打码遮住敏感信息。","url":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2122984134519972212","image":{"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXZaYQ0a0AAUCvw.jpg","width":1704,"height":1652},"published_at":"2026-11-18T17:23:55+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T19:49:27+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"vista8","display_name":"向阳乔木","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXZaYQ0a0AAUCvw.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1960882043249942533/h4J39ERy_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":6,"view":10308,"like":28,"quote":0,"reply":52,"repost":1},"comments":[{"handle":"jxzsqdtg1","display_name":"Tetribe","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2118741684473446402/kBFN2sNC_400x400.jpg","text":"做Gif还顺手把敏感信息打了码，这种不需要提醒的细节才见水平","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:19:55+08:00","url":"https://x.com/jxzsqdtg1/status/2123073723892912508","like":0},{"handle":"CalebOperator","display_name":"Caleb — AI Operator","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2117979940989947904/1pD49R50_400x400.jpg","text":"自动打码这点确实加分，尤其是账号名、余额这种做演示时容易漏的地方。要是导出前还能列出遮住了哪些内容，让人确认一次，就更放心了。","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:19:20+08:00","url":"https://x.com/CalebOperator/status/2123073577717039268","like":0},{"handle":"Worldwide2060","display_name":"Aivatar","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2120040347149709312/0teU2Odi_400x400.jpg","text":"聪明的模型不是跑分高，是替你想到你没说的那一步。\n自动打码这件事很小，但它说明模型开始理解什么不该出现。\n跑分决定的是一时，省心决定的才是每天用不用它。","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:12:51+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Worldwide2060/status/2123071944572699026","like":0},{"handle":"66laoliu66","display_name":"Remi LIN","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2017627760819376129/5-iCb6ZW_400x400.jpg","text":"截图丢过去 敏感信息那几块它自己就给遮上了 这步不用你盯着？🐼","published_at":"2026-11-18T22:43:19+08:00","url":"https://x.com/66laoliu66/status/2123064513582993732","like":0},{"handle":"leonyann777","display_name":"leon","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2085034556747636736/jIMYCsup_400x400.jpg","text":"看到你们能稳定用上opus，我馋的要死🤣","published_at":"2026-11-18T22:35:02+08:00","url":"https://x.com/leonyann777/status/2123062431379529917","like":0},{"handle":"jxzsqdtg1","display_name":"Tetribe","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2118741684473446402/kBFN2sNC_400x400.jpg","text":"做动图顺手就把敏感信息挡掉，这种不需要提醒的自觉才算聪明","published_at":"2026-11-18T22:13:24+08:00","url":"https://x.com/jxzsqdtg1/status/2123056986107601044","like":0},{"handle":"TedCai233","display_name":"Ted Cai","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2108547946652618752/BZP_DxSA_400x400.jpg","text":"优雅，太优雅了claude","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:55:36+08:00","url":"https://x.com/TedCai233/status/2123052504695157087","like":0},{"handle":"dlcwshi","display_name":"Jason.Sze","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2096206969136963584/KAC15arZ_400x400.jpg","text":"这种细心才叫好用。截图自动打码这种小事，用过一次就会离不开，比跑分有感觉多了","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:55:09+08:00","url":"https://x.com/dlcwshi/status/2123052392505917857","like":0},{"handle":"0x5668_nft","display_name":"mango是汪不是兔","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2121618354406555648/bwEey7nf_400x400.jpg","text":"自动打码这细节，省了多少后顾之忧","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:44:39+08:00","url":"https://x.com/0x5668_nft/status/2123049750266360264","like":0},{"handle":"jiaxintang5065","display_name":"Jiaxintang","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2109674324613640192/18Kl5xYU_400x400.jpg","text":"教学里用 AI 处理截图，最怕学生姓名、学号一起被带出去。与其事后自己涂，不如在系统提示里写死：凡导出、做演示，默认遮挡姓名和证件号，再让人确认一遍。模型能主动想到这一层，比单纯跑分有用多了。","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:25:50+08:00","url":"https://x.com/jiaxintang5065/status/2123045013643055107","like":0}]},"translated":false},{"id":"x-vista8:2122982717411504449","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-vista8","source_name":"向阳乔木","title":"","summary":"GPT 6.2 sol 现在能 开 Ultra Fast，速度相当可以。 但前端设计审美依然拉胯，这个真的还挺重要的。","body":"GPT 6.2 sol 现在能 开 Ultra Fast，速度相当可以。\n\n但前端设计审美依然拉胯，这个真的还挺重要的。","url":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2122982717411504449","image":{"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXZZWA1bIAA1v0M.jpg","width":2478,"height":1856},"published_at":"2026-11-18T17:18:17+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T19:49:27+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"vista8","display_name":"向阳乔木","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXZZWA1bIAA1v0M.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1960882043249942533/h4J39ERy_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":5,"view":7705,"like":23,"quote":0,"reply":43,"repost":0},"comments":[{"handle":"Jonasxu000","display_name":"Jonas Xu","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2108588809369899010/Hc3_3qQ6_400x400.jpg","text":"今天拿四款做了同一个网页，功能都过了，结果界面我还是更喜欢旧的6 Astra😂 6.2倒是少了不少小字注释，这点舒服多了。","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:17:46+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Jonasxu000/status/2123042983113335075","like":1},{"handle":"Hsanli_x","display_name":"Hsanli（互关）","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2068628897286279168/erEhMoyZ_400x400.jpg","text":"妈的又是这种米黄配墨绿的大圆角卡片，跟套了同一个模子似的","published_at":"2026-11-18T18:12:43+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Hsanli_x/status/2122996414141915156","like":1},{"handle":"longhaiqwe123","display_name":"龙海","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2113192869897146368/aVlq1cjk_400x400.jpg","text":"这审美 OpenAI 咋就做不好呢，好几代模型了依旧拉跨🥴","published_at":"2026-11-18T17:19:26+08:00","url":"https://x.com/longhaiqwe123/status/2122983005816017246","like":1},{"handle":"leonfu2012","display_name":"煜见 AI 未来｜AI 实测","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1935368445132161030/boZ3YQmJ_400x400.jpg","text":"审美这块我已经不指望模型自己有了，直接喂模板。前两天用 Claude Code 做动效视频，OpenMotion 那种 300 多份动效 DESIGN.md 套进去，出来的东西立马像样。Sol 快，再配上模板，可能才是最顺手的组合。","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:44:21+08:00","url":"https://x.com/leonfu2012/status/2123079871865970704","like":0},{"handle":"jxzsqdtg1","display_name":"Tetribe","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2118741684473446402/kBFN2sNC_400x400.jpg","text":"跑得快大家抢着用，界面丑到想换竞品，OpenAI的设计团队该补课了","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:20:24+08:00","url":"https://x.com/jxzsqdtg1/status/2123073847511634351","like":0},{"handle":"Mikewake2000","display_name":"Mike","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2108758493352394752/A0DKSTHw_400x400.jpg","text":"开不起啊","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:18:22+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Mikewake2000/status/2123073335781462356","like":0},{"handle":"Worldwide2060","display_name":"Aivatar","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2120040347149709312/0teU2Odi_400x400.jpg","text":"Sol 本来就便宜，2 美元输入，Ultra Fast 一开速度确实可以。\n内容被 AI 引用的成本结构可能要变了。\n以前贵模型才舍得跑的引用，现在便宜模型也能跑，量一起来，GEO 的打法也得跟着变。\n深圳大会上这个话题值得单开一场聊聊。","published_at":"2026-11-18T22:21:36+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Worldwide2060/status/2123059047977107585","like":0},{"handle":"jxzsqdtg1","display_name":"Tetribe","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2118741684473446402/kBFN2sNC_400x400.jpg","text":"跑得再快也不是一眼看上去像十年前做的就能过关，UI 这块 OpenAI 得认真补课","published_at":"2026-11-18T22:13:44+08:00","url":"https://x.com/jxzsqdtg1/status/2123057070396281231","like":0},{"handle":"0x5668_nft","display_name":"mango是汪不是兔","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2121618354406555648/bwEey7nf_400x400.jpg","text":"速度上来了，审美还得再等等","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:37:44+08:00","url":"https://x.com/0x5668_nft/status/2123048008753573941","like":0},{"handle":"grayboxlab","display_name":"灰盒","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2118366910685564928/tHhZbkkQ_400x400.jpg","text":"速度我没对过表，倒是让它核过一轮在线表格。\n写完 150 行，它没直接说搞定，自己又把表格读了一遍，逐行对了结果。\nhttps://t.co/x9LRKlt2TU","published_at":"2026-11-18T20:25:58+08:00","url":"https://x.com/grayboxlab/status/2123029950538342512","like":0}]},"translated":false}]}